T1  - Toward secure AI: detection and mitigation of backdoor attacks
AU  - Ahmad, Adil
AU  - Shah, Anwar
AU  - Saeed, Muhammad Irfan
AU  - Khalid, Muhammad
AU  - Zaman, Qamar Uz
